cohort_provenance.verbatim_source:
David-like thou didst flourish in the house of the Lord like a palm tree, O venerable father, having now multiplied an hundredfold the fruits of thy labors;

=== LEAF p158 ===
therefore, O blessed Paul, having drowned the host of demons by the torrents of thy tears, thou hast received from Christ the prize and the crown of victory, and, O all-wise one, an enviably rich grace of miracles.

